  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With an integer array `nums` of **positive** integers, output *the average value of all even integers that are divisible by* `3`*.*\n\nKeep in mind that the **average** of `n` elements is the **sum** of the `n` elements divided by `n` and **rounded down** to the nearest integer.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [1,3,6,10,12,15]\nOutput: 9\nExplanation: 6 and 12 are even numbers that are divisible by 3. (6 + 12) / 2 = 9.\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [1,2,4,7,10]\nOutput: 0\nExplanation: There is no single number that satisfies the requirement, so return 0.\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `1 <= nums.length <= 1000`\n* `1 <= nums[i] <= 1000`",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
